    <ruling:G-09> 34: | G-09 | Every view the clerk can see is a screen, messages and refusals included |
    <ruling:G-09> 308: **Recommendation — a proposal for the owner's ruling, not a decision.** We recommend Position A: every view the clerk can see, messages and refusals included, is a screen on the list of register line 238 and carries the words.
    <ruling:Q-14> 281: **Proposal — not a decision.** We recommend that "share" ignore capitals, as the search does.
